# POLLY, the screens: every page in its states, shot for reading (each element: what is it for, is it needed here, is it
# said twice; each colour one meaning: docs/superpowers/specs/2026-10-11-visibility-design.md), and the screen audit's
# bugs, each an expect: (1) HOME held rang a progression teal ("playing") after the stop; (2) a help card's words ran
# past its box (the simulator fails on that by itself); (3) Song's TRANSP heading sat over the melodies' mute squares
# (the simulator fails on columns over each other); (4) Effects' list offered the grooves' actions; (5) MEMORY's rows
# were named three ways; (6) HOME's list offered CLEAR PROGRESSION while free; (7) the first footer hid REC's job.
# Pages: 0 Home, 1-2 Song, 4-5 Progression, 6 Band, 7 Groove length, 8 Sound, 9 Sound 2, 10 Mixer, 11 Mixer tone,
# 12 Effects, 13-14 Style, 15 Setup, 16 Status.
wait 300
# ---- (7) the first screen: REC's job in the footer, and where the rest is said
expect footer_is_REC:_NEW_PROG|HOLD_A_BUTTON:_HELP 1
shot home_first.png
# ---- (6) HOME's list, free: nothing of its own to clear
tap SEL
expect list_open 1
expect list_has_CLEAR_PROGRESSION 0
expect list_has_LOAD_PROGRESSION 1
shot list_home_free.png
tap HOME
expect list_open 0
expect footer_is_KEYS:_CHORDS|REC:_NEW_PROGRESSION 1
expect enc_is_SELECT_page|PRE_prog 1
expect tag_is_S1>free 1
# free: a chord played, then playing (the groove's bar at the right, the chord teal while the band plays it)
key 7 down
key 11 down
key 14 down
wait 100
key 7 up
key 11 up
key 14 up
wait 300
shot home_free.png
tap PLAY
wait 1300
shot home_free_playing.png
tap PLAY
wait 300
# ---- (1) HOME held after a stop: nothing rings teal; the progression PLAY starts ringed ink
press HOME
tapkey w2
release HOME
expect mode 1
expect app_loop 3
expect tag_is_S1>P3_Fifties 1
tap SEL
expect list_has_CLEAR_PROGRESSION 1
tap HOME
shot home_loop.png
tap PLAY
wait 2600
expect loop_now 3
shot home_loop_playing.png
press HOME
wait 600
expect home_shown 1
expect held_ring3 1
expect enc_is_SELECT_tempo|PRE_song 1
tapkey w1
expect held_ring2 2
expect held_ring3 1
shot home_held_playing.png
release HOME
wait 2600
expect loop_now 2
tap PLAY
wait 600
expect playing 0
press HOME
wait 600
expect held_ring2 3
expect held_ring3 0
tapkey w0
expect held_ring1 3
expect held_ring2 0
shot home_held_stopped.png
release HOME
wait 300
# a chord over the progression: yours, coral, till its next change
tap PLAY
wait 1200
key 9 down
key 13 down
key 16 down
wait 200
expect override 1
shot home_override.png
key 9 up
key 13 up
key 16 up
tap PLAY
wait 300
# ---- the Progression page: stopped, playing, writing
tap ARP
expect page 4
expect tag_is_S1>P1_Pop 1
expect enc_is_SELECT_page|PRE_prog 1
shot prog.png
turn SELECT 1
shot prog2.png
turn SELECT -1
tap PLAY
wait 1300
shot prog_playing.png
tap PLAY
wait 300
tap REC
wait 100
shot prog_rec.png
tap REC
wait 1500
tap SEL
shot list_prog.png
tap HOME
# ---- HOME recording a new progression (free: Prog "-")
tap HOME
turn K4 -16
expect mode 0
tap REC
expect take 1
shot home_rec_wait.png
tap PLAY
wait 2600
shot home_rec_take.png
key 7 down
key 11 down
key 14 down
wait 100
key 7 up
key 11 up
key 14 up
wait 2400
shot home_rec_written.png
tap REC
tap PLAY
wait 600
# ---- the Song page: sections, the two pages, playing
turn SELECT 1
expect page 1
expect tag_is_S1 1
expect enc_is_SELECT_page|PRE_section 1
shot song_empty.png
tapkey w0
tapkey w2
tapkey w3
expect rows 3
turn K1 -2
turn K4 1
turn SELECT 1
expect page 2
turn K1 2
expect row_key2 2
wait 600
shot song2.png
turn K3 1
expect song_ending 1
turn SELECT 1
expect page 0
turn SELECT 1
expect page 1
wait 600
shot song.png
tap SEL
expect list_has_COPY_SONG_TO 1
shot list_song.png
tap HOME
tap PLAY
wait 3000
shot song_playing.png
tap HOME
wait 600
shot home_song_playing.png
tap PLAY
wait 300
shot home_song.png
# ---- Band: stopped, playing, recording; Groove length
tap SEQ
expect page 6
expect enc_is_SELECT_page|ALG_instrument|PRE_groove 1
shot band.png
tap PLAY
wait 1300
shot band_playing.png
tap REC
wait 2000
shot band_rec.png
tap REC
tap PLAY
wait 300
tap SEL
shot list_band.png
tap HOME
turn SELECT 1
expect page 7
shot groove_length.png
# ---- Sound: an instrument (C1), drums (D1), its page 2; a melody (one page)
tap EDIT
expect page 8
shot sound.png
turn SELECT 1
expect page 9
shot sound2.png
turn ALGO -4
expect track 1
shot sound2_drums.png
turn SELECT 1
shot sound_drums.png
turn ALGO 8
expect lead_sel 1
expect page 8
turn SELECT 1
expect page 8
shot sound_melody.png
tap SEL
shot list_melody.png
tap HOME
turn ALGO -4
expect track 5
# ---- (5) MEMORY: a groove of yours, the song's progressions; every row the same way round
# (the song's Intro is yours: recorded into on Band, the song starting with it)
tap SEL
turn SELECT 12
tap SEL
expect slots_list 1
expect slottext2_is_S1|Intro_(yours)|Pop 1
expect slottext1_is_S1|progressions 1
expect slottext3_is_free 1
shot memory.png
tap HOME
tap HOME
# ---- the Mixer, its tone; Effects; (4) Effects' list: its knobs only
tap LFO
expect page 10
shot mixer.png
turn SELECT 1
shot mixer_tone.png
tap FX
expect page 12
expect enc_is_ 1
expect footer_is_ 1
shot effects.png
tap SEL
expect list_open 1
expect list_has_CLEAR_C1 0
expect list_has_BACK_TO_STYLE 0
expect list_has_CLEAR_GROOVE_A 0
expect list_has_MEMORY 0
shot list_effects.png
tap HOME
# ---- Style; Setup (the knob turned, in words); Status
tap ENV
expect page 13
shot style.png
turn SELECT 1
shot style2.png
tap SEL
shot list_style.png
tap HOME
tap GLO
expect page 15
shot setup.png
turn K4 1
shot setup_click.png
turn SELECT 1
expect page 16
expect knobs_shown 0
shot status.png
# ---- (2) the help cards: each button held alone (the simulator fails on words past the box)
tap EDIT
press EDIT
wait 1200
expect card 5
shot card_edit.png
release EDIT
turn ALGO 4
expect lead_sel 1
press EDIT
wait 1200
shot card_melody.png
release EDIT
turn ALGO -4
tap HOME
turn SELECT 1
press SEL
wait 1200
shot card_sel.png
release SEL
press SAVE
wait 1200
shot card_save_song.png
release SAVE
tap GLO
press GLO
wait 1200
shot card_glo.png
release GLO
tap ARP
press REC
wait 1200
shot card_rec_prog.png
release REC
# ---- a question
tap HOME
turn SELECT 1
tap SEL
turn SELECT 3
tap SEL
expect asking 1
shot question.png
tap HOME
expect asking 0
